{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026w3dZZWe3j11795873986.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在維園舉行的三人籃球世界巡迴賽，香港大師賽，港隊分組賽止步。</p><p></p><p>綠衫的港隊，由查華斯、徐遠成、余普生及劉振星組成，首戰面對西班牙的華倫西亞，早段咬緊比分，落後過1-4，徐遠成射入中距離，追至2分差距。但之後被對方拉開，港隊以8-21落敗。</p><p></p><p>第二場面對，僅三人應戰的蒙古沙珊，穿黑色背心的港隊，早段一度領先，不過對方隨即射入兩分波反先，最終港隊再輸10-16，繼上屆再次分組兩連敗出局。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T15:01:32.829066+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T13:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:14:45.331075+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T14:53:26.900252+00:00","content_hash":"e48bd6d292c5d3e2569b03da3d88671fa6f43d6a7e27c5a8ed14f937d6b9ec63","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}